Lucas

Latent change score models create phantom factors ( change_21 and change_32 in this case). These factor represent the difference between 2 time points, and the I added auto-regressions between them.
In which is different is how to add an instrumental variable. Not sure how to add it in a way that is equivalent to the other method

Here is a good tutorial paper about this model

Kievit, R. A., Brandmaier, A. M., Ziegler, G., van Harmelen, A.-L., de Mooij, S. M. M., Moutoussis, M., Goodyer, I. M., Bullmore, E., Jones, P. B., Fonagy, P., Lindenberger, U., & Dolan, R. J. (2018). Developmental cognitive neuroscience using latent change score models: A tutorial and applications. Developmental Cognitive Neuroscience, 33, 99–117. https://doi.org/10.1016/j.dcn.2017.11.007

